# Cook's Pride (jeuno 16): Naruru and Teigero-Bangero (Lower Jeuno; call-only: their scripts' arms). A WAR 75.
# Turns: Teigero-Bangero's default 34 takes the first turn. Naruru has no default (98 is her script's else).
# The Wonder Magic Set accepted (GM): no arm at Naruru (nor The Lost Cardian's, nor The Kind Cardian's): her 98.
# Completed (GM): 189 (CooksPrideVar 0); option 2: nothing; option 1: the var 1; then 188; option 1: nothing; option 0:
# begun. Accepted without the Super Soup Pot: 186. Teigero-Bangero: not completed: the draw (75 or 32). The pot (GM:
# Hoist the Jelly, Roger's reward): 187 refused on a full inventory, then Mercy Errand Runner, the pot taken, the var 0,
# 3000 gil, a Mythril Ring, fame +13 x3, completed. Completed and The Kind Cardian available: The Lost Cardian's 31
# (its var 0).
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-53.2,-0.1,-139.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.TheWonderMagicSet accepted
login
trigger Naruru                          # The Wonder Magic Set not completed: no arm: 98
finish
quest Jeuno.TheWonderMagicSet completed
trigger Naruru                          # available, the var 0: 189
finish option=2                         # nothing
trigger Naruru                          # 189
finish option=1                         # the var 1
trigger Naruru                          # the var 1: 188
finish option=1                         # nothing
trigger Naruru                          # 188
finish option=0                         # begun
trigger Naruru                          # accepted, no pot: 186
finish
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # the turn: 34
finish
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # The Wonder Magic Set completed; this quest accepted: the draw: 75 or 32
finish
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # the turn: 34
finish
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # the draw again
finish
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # the turn: 34
finish
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # the draw again
finish
keyitem SuperSoupPot                    # GM: Hoist the Jelly, Roger's reward (Windurst Waters Maysoon)
fill-inventory
trigger Naruru                          # the pot: 187
finish                                  # no free slot: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (13446); nothing else
free-inventory
trigger Naruru                          # 187
finish                                  # Mercy Errand Runner; the pot taken; var 0; 3000 gil; Mythril Ring; fame +13 x3; completed
trigger Naruru                          # completed, The Kind Cardian available, theLostCardianVar 0: 31 (The Lost Cardian's)
finish
